-- ============================================================
-- V17: Full catalog seed — subcategories + 5 products per subcategory.
--      ~32 subcategories spanning 8 Kazakh top-level categories.
--      ~160 products with stable Unsplash images, deterministic
--      UUIDs/barcodes (idempotent via ON CONFLICT).
--      Inventory rows are attached to every existing store so the
--      catalog is visible from the StoreScreen.
-- ============================================================

